{
  "method": "Grandparent-channel independence test across all four development outcomes. For each outcome, fit a country-FE panel with cluster-robust SEs: (1) outcome ~ parent_edu, (2) outcome ~ parent_edu + grandparent_edu, (3) outcome ~ grandparent_edu. Per-outcome biological lag: TFR uses parent at T-5 (cohort age 20-24 \u2192 newborn at T) and grandparent at T-33; U5MR uses parent at T-12 (childrearing window) and grandparent at T-40; LE / child-edu use parent at T-28 and grandparent at T-56. WCDE v3 lower secondary completion, both sexes, ages 20-24. Under-5 mortality is log-transformed. Low-education subsample: parent_edu < 50%. Ranking by \u0394R\u00b2 (R\u00b2(M2) \u2212 R\u00b2(M1)).",
